{"id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence.md","title":"简单类型 βη 收缩的合流与唯一短正规形","display":"thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence — 简单类型 βη 收缩的合流与唯一短正规形","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence","aliases":["56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence"],"display":"thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence — 简单类型 βη 收缩的合流与唯一短正规形","depends_on":["[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]","[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","[[56-thm-typed-subject-reduction]]","[[56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization]]","[[56-df-relation-closure]]","[[56-df-confluent]]","[[56-df-locally-confluent]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]","[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]","[[56-thm-sn-implies-wn]]","[[56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form]]"],"source_status":"local-dependency-completion-from-provided-formal-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence — 简单类型 βη 收缩的合流与唯一短正规形"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"884fb16496d08ed1\" href=\"?note=884fb16496d08ed1\" title=\"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus\">56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"650401013847f443\" href=\"?note=650401013847f443\" title=\"56-df-beta-reduction\">56-df-beta-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dfc4da988d3b91c0\" href=\"?note=dfc4da988d3b91c0\" title=\"56-thm-typed-subject-reduction\">56-thm-typed-subject-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"24bd3576f4c5852a\" href=\"?note=24bd3576f4c5852a\" title=\"56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization\">56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"766a1d5bf25248d1\" href=\"?note=766a1d5bf25248d1\" title=\"56-df-locally-confluent\">56-df-locally-confluent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2242dbd4d93961ea\" href=\"?note=2242dbd4d93961ea\" title=\"56-thm-sn-implies-wn\">56-thm-sn-implies-wn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"84b767b970cfd3a0\" href=\"?note=84b767b970cfd3a0\" title=\"56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form\">56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-dependency-completion-from-provided-formal-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"884fb16496d08ed1\" href=\"?note=884fb16496d08ed1\" title=\"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus\">56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</a> 的任意基本类型集和固定类型常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，常元没有额外规则；同类型 α 商为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_A\">\\(\\Lambda_A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{\\beta\\eta}^{\\mathrm{Ty}}\">\\(\\to_{\\beta\\eta}^{\\mathrm{Ty}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"24bd3576f4c5852a\" href=\"?note=24bd3576f4c5852a\" title=\"56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization\">56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization</a>，仅合并 β 与 η 收缩，且在所有应用、抽象上下文下闭合。关系闭包、局部合流、合流与正规形谓词采用相应直接依赖的接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda_A\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda_A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_A\">\\(\\simeq_A\\)</span> 是下式定义的固定类型转换关系。工作于 ZFC。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_A\\coloneqq\\to_{\\beta\\eta}^{\\mathrm{Ty}}\\cap\\Lambda_A^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_A\\coloneqq\\to_{\\beta\\eta}^{\\mathrm{Ty}}\\cap\\Lambda_A^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_A\\coloneqq(\\to_A\\cup\\to_A^{-1})^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\simeq_A\\coloneqq(\\to_A\\cup\\to_A^{-1})^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\\exists!N\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\n\\bigl(M\\to_A^*N\\land\\mathrm{NF}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A,N)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\\exists!N\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\n\\bigl(M\\to_A^*N\\land\\mathrm{NF}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A,N)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\simeq_A N\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\n\\bigl(M\\to_A^*P\\land N\\to_A^*P\\land\\mathrm{NF}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A,P)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\simeq_A N\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\n\\bigl(M\\to_A^*P\\land N\\to_A^*P\\land\\mathrm{NF}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A,P)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此节点补齐所给高阶项文件原来只引用外部原书命题的规范化依赖。陈述依据本书内的项语法、替换、类型保持、强正规化和抽象归约结果进行局部推导，不宣称本次另行读取过原书页图或 OCR。</p>\n<p>局部合流可按两个收缩位置分类：互不包含的位置可交换；位于被保留子项内的收缩随该子项移动，被复制时在有限个副本上逐一收缩，被删除时由另一分支直接汇合。两种必要的 β/η 边界交叠为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda x.Px)N\">\\((\\lambda x.Px)N\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda x.((\\lambda y.P)x)\">\\(\\lambda x.((\\lambda y.P)x)\\)</span>。前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(P)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(P)\\)</span> 时两路均归到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PN\">\\(PN\\)</span>；后者在外层 η 条件下两路得到同一个 α 类。其余同种收缩的嵌套情形按子项结构归纳。所需改名在相应类型的无限变量类中完成，所有汇合步由类型保持留在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_A\">\\(\\Lambda_A\\)</span> 中；惰性常元不会增加交叠。</p>\n<p>强正规化限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_A\">\\(\\Lambda_A\\)</span> 后仍成立，故内部 Newman 引理给出合流；强正规化蕴含正规形存在，合流给出唯一性。转换关系中的任意有限折线因此具有相同的唯一短正规形。这里的正规形针对 βη 收缩；后续高阶项的 η 长形式通过另一个明确的结构刻画构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"884fb16496d08ed1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-beta-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"650401013847f443","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-typed-subject-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"dfc4da988d3b91c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-typed-subject-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization","status":"resolved","id":"24bd3576f4c5852a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-locally-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"766a1d5bf25248d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-locally-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-newman-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-sn-implies-wn","status":"resolved","id":"2242dbd4d93961ea","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-sn-implies-wn]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form","stat