o_A^*P\\land N\\to_A^*P\\land\\mathrm{NF}(\\Lambda_A,\\to_A,P)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\lambda x.Px)N","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda x.((\\lambda y.P)x)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"PN","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_A","display":false}],"bytes":3102,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f6999282aa3dc01","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Typ},\\mathcal B,V_A,F,\\tau_V,\\tau_F,\\Lambda_A,E_\\tau$，令 $\\tau=\\tau_V\\cup\\tau_F$。$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$、$b\\in\\mathcal B$、$n\\in\\mathbb N$。原始项集 $L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$；$H_{n,A}$ 与 $H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}$ 是 $L$ 的子集，$H_A$ 再取同类型 α 商。$\\simeq_A$ 取 [[56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence]] 的固定类型 βη 转换；强正规化含固定类型惰性常元，见 [[56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization]]。箭头串向右结合，空输入类型串以 $b$ 为值；零参数应用以头本身为值。$W_\\lambda=\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$、$\\epsilon=()$、$\\cdot$ 为串连接，$\\preceq$ 取 [[56-df-position]] 的前缀关系。$M,N,P,Q\\in L$、$x\\in V$、$h\\in V\\cup F$、$\\vec N=(N_1,\\ldots,N_k)\\in L^k$；$p\\in W_\\lambda$；子项取值仅在已量化的合法出现位置上调用。常元分支的 $f$ 仅在该分支遍历 $F$，允许 $F=\\varnothing$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence.md]]"}],"outgoing":["884fb16496d08ed1","650401013847f443","dfc4da988d3b91c0","24bd3576f4c5852a","9ddd157960e9574a","c74959a8cb14eaa5","766a1d5bf25248d1","e295b2b3159f2b40","edc2d7f4ffe88f2e","2242dbd4d93961ea","84b767b970cfd3a0"]}